# The R5 buoyancy sample: three boats and four buoys floating by
# og.Buoyancy on a gale's sea (og.Water.wind 20 m/s) under a dark
# overcast: the tick lifts each hull's cells under the waves, so they ride,
# pitch and roll with the swell the renderer draws.
# tests/evidence/r5-water/NOTES.md has the commands and what each frame
# shows.
name "R5 boats"
id "r5-boats"
engine "0.7.7"
entry "src/main.ts"
profile "3d"
tick 60
seed 1
